              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Katema ŋes atiar, “Ekajakait, ijo ijeni.” Kabala ebe, “Lu kes lukepote kotoma aiticanio naepol, elota inapenekec, etwakaŋata kes kotoma aokot nuka Imerekek.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
